Usage: agent-deck group change <source> [<dest>]

Reparent a group (and its subgroups/sessions) under <dest>.
Omit <dest> or pass "" / root to promote the group to root.

Arguments:
  <source>   Full path of the group to move (e.g. personal/project1)
  <dest>     Target parent path (empty = root)

Options:

Examples:
  agent-deck group change project1 work
  agent-deck group change personal/project1 work
  agent-deck group change work/project1              # Move to root
  agent-deck group change work/project1 ""          # Move to root
